      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: I have tried unplugging everything else aside from the vive and no luck. This includes xbox wireless adapter, mouse (which had a analog axis thing for flight sims and such) and keyboard. I have never had this problem before in over 500 hours of play with the same setup.",
