      "value": "@{5ae29a3623f9576804071c88|full_name}: We just went through a major update, so it not happening before the update is pretty much expected.\n\nEither way, try starting up SteamVR. Look at the SteamVR window, and you'll probably see an extra game controller icon. That icon indicates that SteamVR is detecting an additional controller. For some users, these have been things like gaming mice that register themselves as controllers, 3D mouse drivers, etc. \n\nEither way, this should be fixed in the next release.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
